{"value": {"url": "https://api.github.com/repos/Wikidata-Toolkit/Wikidata-Toolkit/pulls/981", "id": 3042202933, "node_id": "PR_kwDOAPZYLM61VFU1", "html_url": "https://github.com/Wikidata-Toolkit/Wikidata-Toolkit/pull/981", "diff_url": "https://github.com/Wikidata-Toolkit/Wikidata-Toolkit/pull/981.diff", "patch_url": "https://github.com/Wikidata-Toolkit/Wikidata-Toolkit/pull/981.patch", "issue_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/Wikidata-Toolkit/Wikidata-Toolkit/issues/981", "commits_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/Wikidata-Toolkit/Wikidata-Toolkit/pulls/981/commits", "review_comments_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/Wikidata-Toolkit/Wikidata-Toolkit/pulls/981/comments", "review_comment_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/Wikidata-Toolkit/Wikidata-Toolkit/pulls/comments{/number}", "comments_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/Wikidata-Toolkit/Wikidata-Toolkit/issues/981/comments", "statuses_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/Wikidata-Toolkit/Wikidata-Toolkit/statuses/7f5a5fcbad1c8ecaf46e22481a9eaa18e3bb23cc", "number": 981, "state": "closed", "locked": false, "title": "fix: avoid dependency on HashMap order in OAuthApiConnectionTest", "user": {"login": "chihyu0917", "id": 71316753, "node_id": "MDQ6VXNlcjcxMzE2NzUz", "avatar_url": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/71316753?v=4", "gravatar_id": "", "url": "https://api.github.com/users/chihyu0917", "html_url": "https://github.com/chihyu0917", "followers_url": "https://api.github.com/users/chihyu0917/followers", "following_url": "https://api.github.com/users/chihyu0917/following{/other_user}", "gists_url": "https://api.github.com/users/chihyu0917/gists{/gist_id}", "starred_url": "https://api.github.com/users/chihyu0917/starred{/owner}{/repo}", "subscriptions_url": "https://api.github.com/users/chihyu0917/subscriptions", "organizations_url": "https://api.github.com/users/chihyu0917/orgs", "repos_url": "https://api.github.com/users/chihyu0917/repos", "events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/chihyu0917/events{/privacy}", "received_events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/chihyu0917/received_events", "type": "User", "user_view_type": "public", "site_admin": false}, "body": "## Root cause & original failures\r\nThe mocked `MockWebServer` dispatcher relied on `HashMap` iteration order when it inspected the POST body.\r\nNonDex shuffling reordered that body with random seeds, leading to mismatched expectations and three recurrent failures:\r\n`testSerialize(org.wikidata.wdtk.wikibaseapi.OAuthApiConnectionTest) Time elapsed: 0.003 sec <<< FAILURE! org.junit.ComparisonFailure: expected:<...secret\",\"username\":\"[foo]\",\"loggedIn\":true,\"t...> but was:<...secret\",\"username\":\"[]\",\"loggedIn\":true,\"t...> `\r\n\r\n`testLogout(org.wikidata.wdtk.wikibaseapi.OAuthApiConnectionTest) Time elapsed: 0.003 sec <<< FAILURE! org.junit.ComparisonFailure: expected:<[foo]> but was:<[]>`\r\n\r\n`testFetchOnlineData(org.wikidata.wdtk.wikibaseapi.OAuthApiConnectionTest) Time elapsed: 0.002 sec <<< ERROR! java.io.IOException: Unexpected HTTP status: 404 Client Error`\r\n\r\n## What Changed\r\n1. It now decodes the POST body into a map of parameters before dispatching, so the mocked API responses no longer depend on the iteration order of the request map, so shuffling can\u2019t break the test anymore. \r\n2. Added small helpers to parse the URL-encoded form body and to identify wbgetentities/userinfo calls, keeping the dispatcher logic readable while making the checks order-insensitive.\r\n\r\n## Reproduce\r\n```\r\nmvn -pl wdtk-wikibaseapi  edu.illinois:nondex-maven-plugin:2.1.7:nondex -Dtest=org.wikidata.wdtk.wikibaseapi.OAuthApiConnectionTest#testSerialize\r\n```\r\n", "labels": [], "milestone": null, "active_lock_reason": null, "created_at": "2025-11-25T03:19:33Z", "updated_at": "2025-11-30T21:10:03Z", "closed_at": "2025-11-30T21:10:03Z", "merged_at": "2025-11-30T21:10:03Z", "merge_commit_sha": "5366fa95adbfd9339e7261613de6f3611cba8779", "assignee": null, "assignees": [], "req